{"english":[{"by":"machine","text":"What? That’s really a bit much. At most, you could say you like this kind of arrangement. I think that’s enough."}],"id":"973168a38d2b46f7","jyutping":"haa2？gam2 jau6 gwo3 fan6 zo2 siu2 siu2 zan1 hai6。nei5 zeoi3 do1 waa6 zung1 ji3 nei5 gam2 ge3 gam2 joeng2 ge3 on1 paai4。gam2 ji5 ging1 gau3 laa3 ngo5 nam2。","jyutpingBy":"corpus","text":"吓？噉又過份咗少少真係。你最多話鍾意你噉嘅噉樣嘅安排。噉已經夠嚹我諗。","words":[{"jyutping":"haa2","pos":"e","text":"吓"},{"jyutping":"gam2","pos":"c","text":"噉"},{"jyutping":"jau6","pos":"d","text":"又"},{"jyutping":"gwo3 fan6","pos":"a","text":"過份"},{"jyutping":"zo2","pos":"u","text":"咗"},{"jyutping":"siu2 siu2","pos":"m","text":"少少"},{"jyutping":"zan1 hai6","pos":"d","text":"真係"},{"jyutping":"nei5","pos":"r","text":"你"},{"jyutping":"zeoi3","pos":"d","text":"最"},{"jyutping":"do1","pos":"a","text":"多"},{"jyutping":"waa6","pos":"v","text":"話"},{"jyutping":"zung1 ji3","pos":"v","text":"鍾意"},{"jyutping":"nei5","pos":"r","text":"你"},{"jyutping":"gam2","pos":"r","text":"噉"},{"jyutping":"ge3","pos":"u","text":"嘅"},{"jyutping":"gam2 joeng2","pos":"r","text":"噉樣"},{"jyutping":"ge3","pos":"u","text":"嘅"},{"jyutping":"on1 paai4","pos":"v","text":"安排"},{"jyutping":"gam2","pos":"c","text":"噉"},{"jyutping":"ji5 ging1","pos":"d","text":"已經"},{"jyutping":"gau3","pos":"v","text":"夠"},{"jyutping":"laa3","pos":"y","text":"嚹"},{"jyutping":"ngo5","pos":"r","text":"我"},{"jyutping":"nam2","pos":"v","text":"諗"}]}
